1041
00:46:30,829 --> 00:46:33,415
Welcome to your third and final challenge.

1042
00:46:35,000 --> 00:46:36,126
The camp bus?

1043
00:46:45,052 --> 00:46:46,386
We must get rid of them.

1044
00:46:47,137 --> 00:46:48,722
